{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2019-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1571184000, "end_date": 1571875199, "month_true_total": 46, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:47:45 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55717002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000691523", "personaname": "Coykoi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/futurecivilian/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 17632, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9573, "last_played": 1689063937, "avatar": "590fab91b4453b723331f457e170887fef986508"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game that you can sink a lot of time into. Beat the game 4 times so far and still need to beat it another 8 times for 100%. That means that you will at least be able to find a lobby when I'm playing.", "timestamp_created": 1571753718, "timestamp_updated": 1571753718, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55711237", "author": {"steamid": "76561198381812810", "personaname": "Greg The Ghoul", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198381812810/", "num_games_owned": 819, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 6317, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3433, "last_played": 1765164220, "avatar": "ca93884921b13276b1f238dd78186122f07e0aea"}, "language": "english", "review": "After finally getting around to beating the game, i'd figure i would go ahead and do my review. This is gonna be a long one.\nWhere do i begin? Well for starters, earth defense force 5 is, well, a \"Soft Reboot\" of the main series. Edf 5 ditches the ravagers and introduces a humanoid alien species. Story wise there isn't much. The story is told similar to previous edf games, listening to dialogue and conversations in the background. Gameplay wise most of it is the same, but edf 5 brings new quality of life gameplay changes. Rangers can now call in vehicles, wing divers can get stronger cores, etc. There is also new weapons and vehicles like the minion buster and the emc. You will face off against enemies old and new, Ants, red ants, green ants (Don't appear til near the end of the game), Spiders, silver spiders etc all return. Some of the new enemies are frogs, aliens etc. Overall, edf 5 is a nice fresh of air for the mainline edf series, i have yet to get iron rain and look at it but if you want to get into the series, edf 5 is a great introdouction. \nAlso on a side note, you can play the dlc missions in mp if the host has it.\nFinal Score: 4/5", "timestamp_created": 1571712629, "timestamp_updated": 1571712629, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55708979", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081576933", "personaname": "Ozone", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ETBLAZE/", "num_games_owned": 461, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 8536, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2474, "last_played": 1776110507, "avatar": "72307dfabbdd135d9ebbf201432bad8e3f90ddaf"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is so fun that every time I play it I have the crippling fear I'm turning into a weeb.", "timestamp_created": 1571697172, "timestamp_updated": 1571697172, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.484496176242828369", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55682543", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996040992", "personaname": "cowbell", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/emperor20/", "num_games_owned": 3355, "num_reviews": 71, "playtime_forever": 22635, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15154, "last_played": 1728610233, "avatar": "487b38ebb8c57c2d0e9ecd7bea5166916df21cfd"}, "language": "english", "review": "There are not enough bugs for all the explosions you can drop on the planet. Maybe if you get the mission packs DLC.\nReal excited for EDF6.", "timestamp_created": 1571554548, "timestamp_updated": 1700604945, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513739883899688721", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55649940", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049215672", "personaname": "brotherbenben", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049215672/", "num_games_owned": 691, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 2836, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1005, "last_played": 1710304424, "avatar": "3787b1fe30617ca648679aedf71ed575898a63fd"}, "language": "english", "review": "It gud", "timestamp_created": 1571373277, "timestamp_updated": 1571373277, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.475595951080322266", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}